<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that Bell Atlantic Corp, NYNEX Corp, PAR Technology Corp and Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd were unavailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable were Corimon SACA and Centennial Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
